WEBVTT

00:08:27.892 --> 00:08:30.446
(Laughter)

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:34.359
(Applause)

00:08:38.037 --> 00:08:40.789
These values, though --
they have to be genuine.

00:08:41.345 --> 00:08:44.440
I was giving a talk at a Christian college
a number of years ago,

00:08:44.464 --> 00:08:47.940
and after my talk, a fellow scientist
came up and he said,

00:08:47.964 --> 00:08:49.165
"I need some help.

00:08:49.189 --> 00:08:52.510
I've been really trying hard
to get my foot in the door

00:08:52.534 --> 00:08:54.307
with our local churches,

00:08:54.331 --> 00:08:56.255
but I can't seem to get any traction.

00:08:56.279 --> 00:08:59.068
I want to talk to them
about why climate change matters."

00:08:59.092 --> 00:09:00.934
So I said, "Well, the best thing to do